{
  "about": "Arabic for the generated Learn dossier titles in learn_v1.json. clubs: by Transfermarkt club id (every club stop, every club card, every route end). teams: by the English team name exactly as xi_v1.json writes it in team, opponent and score. parts: the pieces of a title; compose them in the order of the 'compose' lines, in logical (typing) order. The arrow is U+2190 and the score dash is U+2013 on purpose: do not swap them for → or a hyphen.",
  "compose": [
    "squad: {stop} · {todays_stars | todays_squad | todays_squad_part}   e.g. ريال مدريد · النجوم الحاليون",
    "era: {stop} · {decade} for one decade, {stop} · {decade_span} for a span; {start}, {first}, {last} are the decade's first year (1990s -> 1990)   e.g. نابولي · عقود 1980–2020",
    "route: {route} · {route_moved[plural form of n]}   e.g. أرسنال ← برشلونة · انتقل 11 لاعباً",
    "night: {score}[ {aet} | {pens}] · {competition, or first_leg/second_leg around it} {year}   e.g. ليفربول 0–1 ريال مدريد · نهائي دوري أبطال أوروبا 2022",
    "nation: {nation} · {world_cup | euro}   e.g. ألمانيا · كأس العالم 2014",
    "{stop} is clubs[club_id].ar for a club stop, else the stop's own name.ar; {nation} is the nations stop's name.ar.",
    "Plural form of n (Arabic CLDR): 0 zero, 1 one, 2 two, n%100 in 3..10 few, n%100 in 11..99 many, else other."
  ],
